WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:03.169
-I mentioned football is back,
and the first game of the season

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.837
was earlier tonight
right here on on NBC.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.273
Tampa Bay Buccaneers
versus the Dallas Cowboys.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.008
And as you know,
at the end of every season,

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.544
they give out awards like
Most Valuable Player.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:14.313
But they also give out awards
at the start of the season.

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:15.482
I'll show you what I mean.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.784
It's time for
"Tonight Show Superlatives."

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:24.991
-♪ "Tonight Show Superlatives" ♪

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:28.961
-Our first player from the Bucs
is Rob Gronkowski.

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:30.730
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.900
He was voted Most Likely to Yell
"Spring Break!" In September.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.503
And you know, it's Spring Break
somewhere, man.

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:40.773
Next up from the Cowboys
is Leighton Vander Esch.

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:44.611
He was voted Most Likely To Have
"Neck Day" At The Gym.

00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:47.480
It's neck day, bro.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.482
Can you spot my --
-Spot my neck.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.017
-Next up from the Bucs
is Vita Vea.

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:53.920
He was voted Most Likely
To Say His Own Name

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.421
Like The Little Caesar's Guy.

00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:56.489
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:57.624
Vita Vea.
-Vita Vea.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.559
-Vita Vea.
-Vita Vea.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:02.528
-Next up from the Cowboys
is CeeDee Lamb.

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.363
He was voted Most Likely
To Prank Calls

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:06.366
With The Fake Name
"Cee Deez Nuts."

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.401
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.603
Hey, can I have
some pizza, please?

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:11.871
-Got caller I.D.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:15.341
-Next up from the Bucs
is Grant Stuard.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.443
He was voted Most Likely
To Do A Touchdown Dance

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:19.446
To Kenny G.'s "Songbird."

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:21.447
[ Band plays
Kenny G.'s "Songbird" ]

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:25.552
♪♪

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:29.255
Next up from the Cowboys
is DeMarcus Lawrence.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.890
He was voted Most Likely To Say

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.826
"You Better Watch Out, I'm
Wearing My Football Glasses."

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.362
[ Applause ]

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:39.065
Next up from the Cowboys
is Connor Williams.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:41.033
He was voted Most Likely
To Reply, "I Didn't Eat

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:43.402
Any Gummies" To Any Question
You Ask Him.

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:46.172
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.408
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:51.110
Next up from the Bucs,
we have Leonard Fournette.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.147
He was voted Most Likely
To Have A Magnetic Beard.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:57.951
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.786
Don't sneeze. Don't sneeze.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.654
And finally,
we have the quarterback

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.256
of the Bucs, Tom Brady.

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.858
He was voted Most Likely To Lose
A Super Bowl Ring And Say,

00:02:05.858 --> 00:02:07.359
"Eh, I'll Get A New One."

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:09.562
There you go --
there's your NFL superlatives.

